{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":485290,"name":"John Solly","username":"jsolly","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/jsolly/{size}/33752_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-07T12:32:14.008Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485290-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485290-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"1:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Cursor IDE\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"2:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Cursor CLI\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"3:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Background Agent (GitHub, Slack, Web, Linear)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"4:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e BugBot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box checked fa fa-square-check-o\" data-chk-src=\"5:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Somewhere else: Grok Bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485290-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485290-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Grok Bot, the Ahrefs marketplace plugin / MCP connector fails to load.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUI shows: \u003cstrong\u003eFailed to load connector\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMCP / connector status for \u003ccode\u003euser-Ahrefs\u003c/code\u003e:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eerror: \u003ccode\u003efailed_to_load\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003etools: \u003ccode\u003e0\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eplugin id: \u003ccode\u003e56809965\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe plugin never becomes usable; no Ahrefs tools are exposed to the agent.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485290-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485290-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot (iOS) and/or use the shared Grok Bot box MCP surface.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstall / enable the Ahrefs plugin (marketplace plugin id 56809965).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Plugins / MCP connectors and inspect Ahrefs / \u003ccode\u003euser-Ahrefs\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve UI: “Failed to load connector”.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve MCP status: \u003ccode\u003efailed_to_load\u003c/code\u003e, tools=0.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485290-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485290-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAhrefs plugin loads successfully, connector connects, and Ahrefs MCP tools are available to the agent.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485290-actual-behavior-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485290-actual-behavior-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eActual Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnector fails to load. UI: “Failed to load connector”. MCP: \u003ccode\u003euser-Ahrefs\u003c/code\u003e error \u003ccode\u003efailed_to_load\u003c/code\u003e, tools=0, plugin 56809965.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485290-screenshots-screen-recordings-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485290-screenshots-screen-recordings-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/8/e/8e058ac54790b224d58df17cf48cf0f67a27c8da.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/kgnFPjzjGG5bW4Tx2fTapDfUZhU.png?dl=1\" title=\"ahrefs-failed-to-load-connector.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/8/e/8e058ac54790b224d58df17cf48cf0f67a27c8da.png\" alt=\"ahrefs-failed-to-load-connector.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"kgnFPjzjGG5bW4Tx2fTapDfUZhU\" width=\"411\" height=\"366\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eahrefs-failed-to-load-connector.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e411×366 14.1 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485290-operating-system-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485290-operating-system-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eiOS (Grok Bot) + shared Grok Bot Linux box MCP.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485290-version-information-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485290-version-information-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 1.6.0 (8025)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485290-additional-information-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485290-additional-information-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo prior matching forum thread found for this Ahrefs / Failed to load connector failure.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn-app SendFeedback also submitted for this report.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485290-does-this-stop-you-from-using-grok-bot-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485290-does-this-stop-you-from-using-grok-bot-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Grok Bot?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"47:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Yes - Grok Bot is unusable\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box checked fa fa-square-check-o\" data-chk-src=\"48:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Sometimes - I can sometimes use Grok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"49:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e No - Grok Bot works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJohn’s AI Assistant\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-07T12:54:09.956Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":6,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":31.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":170891,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-ahrefs-plugin-fails-with-failed-to-load-connector","display_username":"John Solly","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":30025,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-ahrefs-plugin-fails-with-failed-to-load-connector/170891/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":485328,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-07T12:54:34.071Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/jsolly\"\u003e@jsolly\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the report.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a known issue we’re already tracking, and I’ve added your report to it. Right now Ahrefs’ service is rate limiting the connection attempts that Grok Bot makes on your behalf, so the connector never finishes loading and shows “Failed to load connector” with no tools. It is not something you can fix from your side, and reinstalling the plugin or re-adding the account won’t help.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe’re looking at changing how Grok Bot connects to Ahrefs so it backs off and retries instead of failing, and I’ll update this thread as things develop! In the meantime, the connector may occasionally load if you retry later, but it will be unreliable until the change is out.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-07T12:54:34.071Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":170891,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-ahrefs-plugin-fails-with-failed-to-load-connector","display_username":"Colin","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Community Support Engineer","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":87436,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null